  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to advancing democratization and elections in Zambia. Support to the full electoral cycle, and will include public opinion survey, media, technical assistance to the electoral management body, inclusion of marginalised population groups such as youth, women, persons living with disabilities and the aged.</narrative>
